  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        40.888328552246094,
        59.86054992675781,
        162.59165954589844,
        77.21453857421875
      ],
      "text": "Introduction\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.90700912475586,
        130.1884002685547,
        425.1079406738281,
        143.28578186035156
      ],
      "text": "Prepare for the exam with practice tests from Cambridge\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.252803802490234,
        157.66537475585938,
        453.30450439453125,
        181.88206481933594
      ],
      "text": "Inside you'll find four authentic examination papers from Cambridge Assessment English.\nThey are the perfect way to practise - EXACTLY like the real exam.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.252803802490234,
        208.36692810058594,
        186.5930633544922,
        221.1368408203125
      ],
      "text": "Why are they unique?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.57991409301758,
        234.862548828125,
        457.9231262207031,
        271.8360595703125
      ],
      "text": "All our authentic practice tests go through the same design process as the IELTS test. We\ncheck every single part of our practice tests with real students under exam conditions, to\nmake sure we give you the most authentic experience possible.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        39.90704345703125,
        274.1153564453125,
        463.7062072753906,
        297.3507385253906
      ],
      "text": "Students can practise these tests on their own or with the help of a teacher to familiarise\nthemselves with the exam format, understand the scoring system and practise exam technique.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        40.88835525512695,
        324.48974609375,
        171.8290557861328,
        334.3127746582031
      ],
      "text": "Further information\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        40.23411560058594,
        350.98541259765625,
        423.1941833496094,
        375.20208740234375
      ],
      "text": "IELTS is jointly managed by the British Council, IDP: IELTS Australia and Cambridge\nAssessment English. Further information can be found on the IELTS official website at\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        40.561222076416016,
        378.46234130859375,
        76.87004089355469,
        388.2853698730469
      ],
      "text": "ielts.org.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        40.23411560058594,
        414.7712097167969,
        241.91326904296875,
        424.921630859375
      ],
      "text": "WHAT IS THE TEST FORMAT?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        40.561222076416016,
        441.5939636230469,
        455.3323669433594,
        478.5674743652344
      ],
      "text": "IELTS consists of four components. All candidates take the same Listening and Speaking\ntests. There is a choice of Reading and Writing tests according to whether a candidate is\ntaking the Academic or General Training module.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        48.08466720581055,
        491.6412353515625,
        452.9117126464844,
        557.0756225585938
      ],
      "text": "Academic\nGeneral Training\nFor candidates wishing to study at\nFor candidates wishing to migrate to an\nundergraduate or postgraduate levels, | English-speaking country (Australia, Canada,\nand for those seeking professional\nNew Zealand, UK), and for those wishing to\nregistration.\ntrain or study below degree level.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        41.542503356933594,
        663.0451049804688,
        47.06242752075195,
        671.23095703125
      ],
      "text": "4\n"
    }
